    "ts": "2026-07-30T20:12:35+00:00",
    "headline": "DexCom’s (NASDAQ:DXCM) Q2 CY2026 Sales Beat Estimates",
    "summary": "Medical device company DexCom (NASDAQ:DXCM) announced better-than-expected revenue in Q2 CY2026, with sales up 13.1% year on year to $1.31 billion. The company expects the full year’s revenue to be around $5.22 billion, close to analysts’ estimates. Its non-GAAP profit of $0.70 per share was 15.1% above analysts’ consensus estimates.",
